This package adapts EMSA-PSS encoding and verification, MGF1, and PKCS#1 v1.5
encoded-message construction from the Go standard library, version go1.23.12:

https://github.com/golang/go/blob/go1.23.12/src/crypto/rsa/pss.go
https://github.com/golang/go/blob/go1.23.12/src/crypto/rsa/rsa.go
https://github.com/golang/go/blob/go1.23.12/src/crypto/rsa/pkcs1v15.go

The original BSD license is included in LICENSE. Original copyright notices
are retained in each adapted source file.

Local changes: package/function names; removal of
private-key operations and Go-internal dependencies; exact nonnegative salt
lengths instead of Go's automatic/equal-hash sentinels; defensive integer and
length validation; verification does not mutate its encoded input; supported
DigestInfo hashes restricted to SHA-256, SHA-384, and SHA-512. Public-key RSA
exponentiation and CSPRNG orchestration remain outside this package.
Inherited crypto/rsa error strings are retained; the public piv wrappers add
operation context and expose their own parameter-validation errors.
